  "description": "WAJFIB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H168 Dy4 O24 P4,5.34(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.584-3.968 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.55-114.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C124H168Dy4O24P4·5.34(C2H6O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
